<title>SWEDEN: FORECAST-Swedish interest rates/crown in 1 yr.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Swedish interest rates/crown in 1 yr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the results of a February Reuters poll on Swedish interest rates, debt yields and the crown.</p>
<p>Analysts interviewed for the poll were from AGA, ABB Treasury Center, Atlas Copco, Carnegie, Handelsbanken, HSBC Midland, NCC, Nordbanken, Posten, SCA, Skandia, Swedish Match, Swedbank, Trygg Hansa, and Transferator.</p>
<p>			     AVG	     RANGE	FEB 14</p>
<p>Rates/crown in one month's time</p>
<p> Repo rate (pct)	 4.00	  3.85-4.10     4.10</p>
<p> Six month T-bill rate 3.93	  3.80-4.00     4.00</p>
<p> Ten year bond yield   6.64	  6.50-7.20     6.63</p>
<p> Crown/mark		4.39	  4.35-4.45     4.39</p>
<p>Rates/crown in three month's time</p>
<p> Repo rate (pct)	 3.80	  3.70-4.00</p>
<p> Six month T-bill rate 3.80	  3.60-4.25</p>
<p> Ten year bond yield   6.58	  6.30-7.15</p>
<p> Crown/mark		4.34	  4.30-4.45</p>
<p>Rates/crown in one year</p>
<p> Repo rate (pct)	 3.68	  3.25-4.00</p>
<p> Six month T-bill	3.92	  3.25-4.30</p>
<p> Ten year bond yield   6.88	  6.20-7.70</p>
<p> Crown/mark		4.33	  4.18-4.50</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
